@startuml vision360-paquetes
title Vista de desarrollo – Visión Integral 360 (diagrama de paquetes)
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Presentación web" as PRES <<presentación>> {
  component "VistaPanorama" as VP
  component "PanelAdministracion" as PA
}

package "Seguimiento" as SEG <<dominio>> {
  component "ControlConsultaPanorama" as CCP
  component "ControlIndicadoresAvance" as CIA
  CCP ..> CIA : <<include>> CU-01 → CU-04
}

package "Núcleo de proyectos" as NUC <<dominio>> {
  component "Proyecto" as PRO
  component "Iniciativa" as INI
  component "Requerimiento" as REQ
  component "Hito" as HIT
  component "Avance" as AVA
  component "FuenteInformacion" as FUE
  component "RegistroSincronizacion" as RSI
}

package "Alertas" as ALE <<dominio>> {
  component "ControlAlertasDesviaciones" as CAD
  component "ReglaAlerta" as RAL
  component "Alerta" as ALT
  component "RegistroEvaluacion" as REV
}

package "Integración de fuentes" as INT <<integración>> {
  component "ControlIntegracion" as CIN
  component "AdaptadorRedmine" as ADR
  component "AdaptadorExcel" as ADE
}

package "Seguridad y permisos" as SEC <<utilitario>> {
  component "PerfilUsuario" as PUS
}

package "Registro de errores" as LOG <<utilitario>> {
  component "RegistroErrores" as ERR
}

package "Persistencia" as PER <<plataforma>> {
  component "BaseDatosRelacional" as BDD
}

package "Tareas programadas" as TAR <<plataforma>> {
  component "Planificador" as PLA
}

PRES ..> SEG : consultar panorama
PRES ..> INT : sincronización manual (CU-09 FA-04)
SEG ..> NUC : recuperar proyectos y avances
SEG ..> ALE : mostrar alertas (CU-04)
SEG ..> SEC : verificar permisos (CU-01)
ALE ..> NUC : evaluar proyectos e hitos
INT ..> NUC : consolidar Redmine y Excel
INT ..> ALE : <<include>> CU-09 → CU-10
NUC ..> PER : persistir
INT ..> LOG : registrar problemas de fuente
ALE ..> LOG : registrar causa de fallo

note as N1
Temporizador externo (actor) invoca ControlIntegracion y
ControlAlertasDesviaciones. Su configuración vive en Planificador;
no genera una dependencia de código, por eso no tiene flecha.
Redmine y Excel online son sistemas externos: se acceden solo
por los adaptadores.
end note

@enduml
